    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_Room Availability Management API",
    "description": "The Room Availability Management API enables businesses to efficiently manage and monitor the availability of hotel rooms. This API allows users to submit availability data for rooms, enabling real-time updates and optimizations for booking systems. Typical consumers include hotel management systems and travel booking platforms that need accurate and up-to-date room availability information. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance their booking processes and improve customer satisfaction.",
